New:
• "Teams" are now called groups. If you share your location, you show up in all your groups.
• Invites, roles and removals take effect right away.
• New role: group manager, who looks after the group's people and invites.
• The owner chooses the administrators on a new screen.
• No more 99-group limit; the create group button is larger.
• Softer map colors and the OpenStreetMap credit; the group list follows the organization's colors.
• Signing in and creating an organization are clearer.
